<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">2.4 <U>Additional Allocation</U>.
The Company hereby acknowledges and agrees that upon the terms and subject to the conditions set forth herein, including the waiver of
